{"name":"Mid Century Furniture","hex":"#ae5c1b","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"mid","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Symbol","definitions":["ISO 639-3 language code for Mandaic."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Occupying a middle position; middle.","Made with a somewhat elevated position of some certain part of the tongue, in relation to the palate; midway between the high and the low; said of certain vowel sounds, such as, [e o ɛ ɔ]."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/mid"},{"term":"century","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A period of one hundred consecutive years; often specifically a numbered period with conventional start and end dates, e.g., the twentieth century, which stretches from (strictly) 1901 through 2000, or (informally) 1900 through 1999. The first century AD was from 1 to 100.","A unit in ancient Roman army, originally of one hundred army soldiers as part of a cohort, later of more varied sizes (but typically containing sixty to seventy or eighty) soldiers or other men (guards, police, firemen), commanded by a centurion."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/century"},{"term":"furniture","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Large movable item(s), usually in a room, which enhance(s) the room's characteristics, functionally or decoratively.","The harness, trappings etc. of a horse, hawk, or other animal."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/furniture"}],"entries":[{"title":"Century","blocks":[{"text":"A century is a numerical value of 100 or more popularly period of 100 years. Centuries are numbered ordinally in English and many other languages. The word century comes from the Latin centum, meaning one hundred. Century is sometimes abbreviated as c. currently the 21st century is ongoing, started on first January 2000."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Century","wikidata":"Q578"},{"title":"Furniture","blocks":[{"text":"Furniture refers to objects intended to support various human activities, such as seating, eating (tables), storing items, working, and sleeping. Furniture is also used to hold objects at a convenient height for work, or to store things. Furniture can be a product of design and can be considered a form of decorative art. In addition to furniture's functional role, it can serve a symbolic or religious purpose. It can be made from a vast multitude of materials, including metal, plastic, and wood. Furniture can be made using a variety of woodworking joints, which often reflects the local culture."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/24/8th_Century_BCE_Assyrian_Plaque_from_Fort_Shalmaneser._in_Nimrud.jpg/330px-8th_Century_BCE_Assyrian_Plaque_from_Fort_Shalmaneser._in_Nimrud.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Furniture","wikidata":"Q14745"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/af/Chair_of_Reniseneb_MET_DT536.jpg/500px-Chair_of_Reniseneb_MET_DT536.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/af/Chair_of_Reniseneb_MET_DT536.jpg/1280px-Chair_of_Reniseneb_MET_DT536.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/af/Chair_of_Reniseneb_MET_DT536.jpg/500px-Chair_of_Reniseneb_MET_DT536.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AChair_of_Reniseneb_MET_DT536.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/19/Brasero_de_Pompeya.jpg/500px-Brasero_de_Pompeya.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/19/Brasero_de_Pompeya.jpg/500px-Brasero_de_Pompeya.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_c